     \end{align}
     Note that if $\bm{UU}^{\top} = \bm{M}$ then the result is trivially proven, so without loss of generality we may assume $\|\bm{UU}^{\top} - \bm{M} \|_F$ is positive.  Rearranging shows that we must have
