    &\leq s \big( h (\bm{U}_0) + \ensuremath{\varepsilon} \big) + (1-s) h(\bm{U}_0)  - h(\bm{U}_0 + s(\bm{\widehat U}\mathcal{O}_{\bm{\widehat U},\bm{U}_0} - \bm{U}^* )) \\
    &= s \ensuremath{\varepsilon} + h(\bm{U}_0) - h(\bm{U}_0+ s (\bm{\widehat U}\mathcal{O}_{\bm{\widehat U},\bm{U}_0} - \bm{U}_0)) \\
    &\leq s \ensuremath{\varepsilon}.
\end{align}
Rearranging this bound implies that 
\begin{align}
